  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/658928958/v0.40.2</id>
    <updated>2026-10-09T03:37:30Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.40.2"/>
    <title>v0.40.2</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;Model upgrades&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Models downloaded with earlier versions of Ollama are upgraded in the background the first time you run them, for better performance and compatibility when running on llama.cpp.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To make downgrading safe, Ollama keeps the original copy as a backup, so upgraded models are temporarily kept on disk. A future release will remove these backups automatically.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To remove backed up models now (requires &lt;code&gt;jq&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto&quot; data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=&quot;curl -s localhost:11434/api/tags | jq -r &#39;.models[].name&#39; | while read -r m; do
  curl -s localhost:11434/api/show -d &amp;quot;{\&amp;quot;model\&amp;quot;:\&amp;quot;$m\&amp;quot;}&amp;quot; | jq -r \
    &#39;select(any(.manifests[]?; .runner == &amp;quot;llamacpp&amp;quot;)) | .manifests[] | select(.runner == &amp;quot;ggml&amp;quot;) | .digest&#39;
done | sort -u | xargs -n1 ollama rm&quot;&gt;&lt;pre&gt;curl -s localhost:11434/api/tags &lt;span class=&quot;pl-k&quot;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; jq -r &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-pds&quot;&gt;&#39;&lt;/span&gt;.models[].name&lt;span class=&quot;pl-pds&quot;&gt;&#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;pl-k&quot;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;pl-k&quot;&gt;while&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;pl-c1&quot;&gt;read&lt;/span&gt; -r m&lt;span class=&quot;pl-k&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;pl-k&quot;&gt;do&lt;/span&gt;
  curl -s localhost:11434/api/show -d &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-pds&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;{&lt;span class=&quot;pl-cce&quot;&gt;\&quot;&lt;/span&gt;model&lt;span class=&quot;pl-cce&quot;&gt;\&quot;&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;span class=&quot;pl-cce&quot;&gt;\&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-smi&quot;&gt;$m&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-cce&quot;&gt;\&quot;&lt;/span&gt;}&lt;span class=&quot;pl-pds&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;pl-k&quot;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; jq -r \
    &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-pds&quot;&gt;&#39;&lt;/span&gt;select(any(.manifests[]?; .runner == &quot;llamacpp&quot;)) | .manifests[] | select(.runner == &quot;ggml&quot;) | .digest&lt;span class=&quot;pl-pds&quot;&gt;&#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;pl-k&quot;&gt;done&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;pl-k&quot;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; sort -u &lt;span class=&quot;pl-k&quot;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; xargs -n1 ollama rm&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This only deletes the backups. If you later downgrade to a version older than 0.40, you&#39;ll need to re-pull those models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other changes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;ollama list&lt;/code&gt; no longer shows duplicate entries for upgraded models by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/dhiltgen/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/dhiltgen&quot;&gt;@dhiltgen&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5764624342&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/issues/18874&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ollama/ollama/pull/18874/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18874&quot;&gt;#18874&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;ollama launch claude&lt;/code&gt; uses the model&#39;s full context length by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/jberg5/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/jberg5&quot;&gt;@jberg5&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5753196342&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/issues/18855&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ollama/ollama/pull/18855/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18855&quot;&gt;#18855&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;README: add oxi to community integrations by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/maziluiosif/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/maziluiosif&quot;&gt;@maziluiosif&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5669024353&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/issues/18739&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ollama/ollama/pull/18739/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18739&quot;&gt;#18739&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;New Contributors&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/maziluiosif/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/maziluiosif&quot;&gt;@maziluiosif&lt;/a&gt; made their first contribution in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5669024353&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/issues/18739&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ollama/ollama/pull/18739/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18739&quot;&gt;#18739&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.40.1...v0.40.2-rc0&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v0.40.1...v0.40.2-rc0&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
