    <updated>2026-10-06T15:08:38Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.40.0-rc6"/>
    <title>v0.40.0-rc6: model: add multimodal embeddings (#18820)</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Implements the EmbeddingGemma2Model architecture on the MLX runner: 24-layer&lt;br&gt;
bidirectional text encoder with PLE, shared gemma4 vision/audio towers,&lt;br&gt;
mean-pool + L2 output. /api/embed accepts per-item media via input dicts.&lt;/p&gt;</content>
